        "PMC10759803::chunk::000::abstract::41e69f8748",
        "PMC5978046::chunk::000::abstract::93e23f7e34"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition will enhance precipitation strengthening without disrupting the alloy's low-temperature microstructure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf addition will not impair the thermal conductivity of TiVNbTa.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf-modified alloy will attain a yield strength of approximately 500–600 MPa at 1273 K.",
